# Legacy-deletion checklist: ALL must hold before any raw entrypoint above is removed.
legacy_deletion_checklist:
  - zero_pending | every row is migrated or retained
  - stage3_gate | SIMPLE_STAGE3_COMPILER set and Stage-3 self-host run recorded with mode=typed
  - ihir04_strict | raw HirModule into a target-only MIR entrypoint is a compile type error under strict API
  - legacy_equivalence | disabled/legacy path byte-equivalent MIR on the canary set
  - streaming_bounds | no all-program retained-HIR barrier; RSS within streaming bound
  - rollback_tested | target_hir_mode=legacy rollback exercised after flip
